#: preferences.py:290
msgid "Add a Data Transfer modifier so a placed decal borrows the target's surface normals and shades as part of the curved surface, instead of catching its own flat lighting"
msgstr "添加数据传递修改器，让已放置的贴花借用目标表面的法线，并作为曲面的一部分进行着色，而不是接受自身的平面光照"

#: operators/hardops.py:262
msgid "Add a Weighted Normal modifier at the bottom of the stack so the beveled shading stays crisp"
msgstr "在修改器堆栈底部添加加权法线修改器，使倒角着色保持锐利"

#: operators/hardops.py:464
msgid "Add a face-area Weighted Normal modifier (the workhorse boolean-shading fix)"
msgstr "添加按面面积的加权法线修改器（修复布尔着色的主力方案）"

#: operators/hardops.py:243
msgid "Add a second, smaller angle-limited bevel below the main one so boolean-cut corners get a tight chamfer while the form edges keep the big weighted round -- a bevel hierarchy"
msgstr "在主倒角下方添加第二个更小的角度限制倒角，使布尔切割角获得紧密的倒角，同时形体边缘保留较大的加权圆角——形成倒角层级"

#: operators/draw_cut.py:44
#: ui/panel.py:17
msgid "Add geometry (UNION)"
msgstr "添加几何体（并集）"

#: operators/draw_cut.py:45
#: ui/panel.py:19
msgid "Add the drawn shape as a separate solid (no boolean)"
msgstr "将绘制的形状作为单独实体添加（不进行布尔）"

#: preferences.py:395
msgid "After a boolean CUT, auto-route a pipe/panel-line along the drawn cut boundary (draped onto the surface) so the cut is instantly detailed -- the Hard-Surface -> Decal bridge"
msgstr "布尔切割后，沿绘制的切割边界自动生成管道/面板线（贴合到表面），使切口立即获得细节——硬表面 → 贴花 的桥梁"

#: preferences.py:388
msgid "After a destructive boolean cut, triangulate + rejoin the n-gons the cut left so the surface stays quad-friendly (core.geometry.dissolve_boolean_ngons)"
msgstr "破坏性布尔切割后，对切割留下的 n 边形进行三角化并重新合并，使表面保持四边面友好（core.geometry.dissolve_boolean_ngons）"

#: preferences.py:428
msgid "After a non-destructive cut, reorder the target's modifiers into hard-surface order (Booleans on top, Bevel below, Weighted Normal at the bottom)"
msgstr "非破坏性切割后，将目标的修改器重排为硬表面顺序（布尔在上，倒角在下，加权法线在底部）"

